{"input":[{"content":[{"text":"Evaluate only visible evidence. Frame roles are temporal labels, not proof of success.","type":"input_text"},{"text":"Frame role: after","type":"input_text"},{"image_url":"data:image/png;base64,","type":"input_image"},{"text":"Evaluate only the current declared condition and its supplied current-step evidence. Prior workflow progress and later actions are outside this result check. Do not repeat checks of earlier steps or infer requirements from future tasks.","type":"input_text"},{"text":"Question and allowed choices (JSON): {\"choices\": [{\"description\": \"Visible evidence establishes the declared current result.\", \"value\": \"condition_met\"}, {\"description\": \"Visible evidence contradicts the declared current result.\", \"value\": \"condition_not_met\"}, {\"description\": \"Required evidence is missing, hidden or ambiguous.\", \"value\": \"evidence_insufficient\"}], \"instructions\": \"Check only this visible current result: \\\"A calendar popup with a month grid is currently open beside the Date field.\\\". Choose condition_met if shown, condition_not_met if contradicted, otherwise evidence_insufficient. One static image cannot establish temporal progress or hidden persistence.\", \"name\": \"current_step\", \"type\": \"choice\"}\nOutput exactly one allowed choice value and nothing else. Do not output JSON, explanations, confidence or probabilities.","type":"input_text"}],"role":"user"}],"max_output_tokens":32,"model":"gpt-6-luna","reasoning":{"effort":"none"},"service_tier":"default","store":false}
